        "Doors open at 20:00 with the €15 Royal Aperitivo package, which includes one drink, full access to the gourmet hot-and-cold buffet, participation in the Check&Love game, and complimentary stay for the club session. Guests seeking a full restaurant experience can reserve the 21:00 Seated Dinner at €35 per person, featuring a served menu paired with one bottle of wine every four guests alongside live vocal entertainment.",
